The copyright owner holds all rights to this artwork, including rights
assigned by the original artist. It is NOT released under an open-source
or Creative Commons license.

PERMISSION FOR CLAN MEMBERS

Current members of the Wise Goblin clan may use the logo, free of charge, to:
  - Put it on personal merchandise for themselves or other clan members,
    such as mugs, shirts, hoodies, stickers, banners and patches.
  - Have that merchandise made by a print shop or print-on-demand service.
  - Use it as an avatar, banner or emblem for clan activities, in game
    and online.
  - Make basic adjustments needed for printing, such as resizing, cropping,
    or changing the background color.

CONDITIONS

  - No selling. Do not sell the logo or merchandise bearing it, or profit
    from it in any other way, without written permission from the owner.
  - No other changes. Other modifications, edits or derivative artwork
    need the owner's permission first.
  - No misuse. Do not use the logo with hateful, harassing, illegal,
    sexually explicit or misleading content, or in any way that suggests
    the Wise Goblin clan endorses something it does not.
  - No passing it on. This permission is personal to clan members. Do not
    give the files to anyone else, or let anyone else use the logo.

REVOCATION

This permission ends automatically when someone stops being a clan member.
The owner may also withdraw it from anyone at any time, for any reason,
including misuse. Once permission ends, stop making new items with the
logo. Items made earlier for personal use may be kept.

EVERYONE ELSE

Anyone who is not a current Wise Goblin clan member may not use, copy,
modify or distribute the logo without written permission. To request
permission, contact the owner through github.com/Reskilling.

THE LOGO IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND.
